.Dd May 7, 2021
.Dt LS 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm ls
.Nd list directory contents
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl la
.Op Ar file ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility lists files.
It is \fBbold\fR and \fIitalic\fR.
.Pp
Options:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl l
Long format.
.It Fl a
All entries.
.El
.Ss Exit
Exits 0 on success, see
.Xr stat 2 .
.Bd -literal -offset indent
ls -la /tmp
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr find 1
